4C POST FORMULA
Works for a social post, an email, or a note.

Capture — hook or strong first line. In email, a subject line like "so and so recommended I contact you."
Connect — a personal story or what something meant to you.
Curiosity — talk about their interests, not a list of what you do.
Call to action — click a link, reply, come to the concert.

